                     (Clight.Etempvar ip Ctypesdefs.tulong) (Ctypesdefs.tptr (Ctypes.Tstruct sid Ctypes.noattr)))
                  (Ctypes.Tstruct sid Ctypes.noattr)) f1 (Ctypes.Tstruct sid1 Ctypes.noattr)) f2 Ctypesdefs.tulong)
